#basePath	Day2

:: BeginDay
@trigger    SceneReady
@boostScore 100
@who    Astrid

$call InitUpdateMasks()
$call SetInstrumentUnlocked(CoordinateInstrument, true)
$call SetInstrumentUnlocked(PhotometerInstrument, true)
$call SetInstrumentUnlocked(SpectrometerInstrument, true)
$call SetInstrumentUnlocked(ColorInstrument, true)

$call MoveToView("DocumentPuzzle")
{@Astrid} At least the mail service is working well. 
$call StopPuzzleMode()
$call StopOpenMode()
$call SpawnDocumentToCamera("Day2DadPostcard")
{@Astrid} A postcard from Dad.
$call SetInputState(true)

:: SpawnPuzzleDocs1
@trigger    DocumentInspectEnd
@when   documentId == "Day2DadPostcard"
@once

$call Wait(1)
$call SpawnDocumentToCamera("Day2ElijahPostcard")
{@Astrid} And one from Elijah.

:: SpawnPuzzleDocs2
@trigger    DocumentInspectEnd
@when   documentId == "Day2ElijahPostcard"
@once

$call Wait(1)
$call SpawnDocumentToCamera("Day2Martha")
{@Astrid} And another one from Aunt Martha.

:: DocumentPuzzleStart
@trigger    DocumentInspectEnd
@when   documentId == "Day2Martha"
@once

{@Astrid} Where is Elijah? Is he okay?
$call StartDocumentPuzzle("Day2DocumentPuzzle")

:: IncorrectDocumentResponse1
@trigger    DocumentPuzzlePromptStart
@when documentId == "Day2DadPostcard"

{@Astrid} Elijah at IceCube...? No, that wouldn't make sense.

:: IncorrectDocumentResponse2
@trigger    DocumentPuzzlePromptStart
@when documentId == "Day2DadPostcard"
{@Astrid} So Elijah is staying with Aunt Martha..?

:: CorrectDocumentResponse
@trigger    DocumentPuzzlePromptStart
@when documentId == "Day2ElijahPostcard"
@once

$call SetInputState(false)
{@Astrid} This is it!
$call Wait(1)
$call MoveToView("Desk")
$call Wait(1)

$call MoveToView("Right")
{@Radio} Star HQ to Station Seven.
IceCube is reading a high-energy neutrino emission from the area of the Hydra Constellation. 
Identification of nearby celestial objects is requested. 
Uploading area of interest... (*beeeep screeech boop beep boop beeeep*)

$call WaitForMovedToView("Desk")
$call StartNeutrinoNavigation()
$call SetInputState(true)

:: NeutrinoNavigationComplete
@trigger    NeutrinoNavigationComplete
@once

{@Radio} Neutrino Origin Detected
$call StopNeutrinoNavigation()
$call StartOpenMode()

:: PointsUpdated
@trigger    PointsUpdated
@when   sciencePoints > 2
@once

$call StopOpenMode()
$call ClearMonitorSelection()
$call SetInputState(false)
{@Dad} Hey Astrid, I hope you got my letter about project hercules!

{@Astrid} I did... not that you can hear me...

{@Dad} There's a sattelite, built to withstand a CME. 
If we could decrypt what is stored on it... it would change everything.
Each puzzle reveals part of the password. That's what you've been working on...

{@Astrid} These puzzles.... reveal the password to the satellite...

{@Dad} The satellite was put in orbit by the guy who funded Elijah’s old lab.
Sort of a secret back-up plan, in case anything ever happened.

The guy who built it was... let's just say, excentric. Your next puzzle is the constellation Hercules.
See if the reference guide can point you in the right direction.

$call SetInputState(true)
$call StartPuzzleNavigation()

:: PuzzleNavigationComplete
@trigger    PuzzleNavigationComplete
@once

$call StopPuzzleNavigation()
{@Radio} This is where an instrument unlock would happen.
{@Dad} Please tune radio to 375 mhz...
{@Radio} Unlocking now. Stand By...
$call StartPuzzleMode()

:: HerculesPuzzleComplete
@trigger    CorrectPuzzleSubmission
@when   puzzleName == "Hercules"
@once

$call ClearMonitorSelection()
$call StopPuzzleMode()
$call SetInputState(false)
{@Astrid} Time to turn in for the night.
Oh, what's this?
$call EndDay2->BeginCutscene()

:: EndDay
@trigger    CutsceneEnd
@when cutsceneId == "EndDay2"
@who    Radio

$call LoadNextDay()